iner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Thank You For Submitting Your Case Information to The Drake Law Firm, P.C.</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ec523f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1ec523f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We will get back to you within 1 business day, often within minutes or hours the same day, unless you requested us not to call, we usually will call, otherwise, we will respond in email.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24a4ea5 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"24a4ea5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"tel:303-261-8111\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Call (303) 261-8111</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>Thank You For Submitting Your Case Information to The Drake Law Firm, P.C. We will get back to you within 1 business day, often within minutes or hours the same day, unless you requested us not to call, we usually will call, otherwise, we will respond in email. Call (303) 261-8111</p>\n"
